      "value": "Here's my own mockup of a reordering:\n\nIf we are to keep things the way they've changed that's fine. The new widgets are a little weird but I think that's mostly in the order of them. Just simply re-ordering things like this I think would be a more digestible experience.\n\nAlso, 100% the \"Live Now\" should be renamed to \"Activity\" and maybe it should get a different icon or something. Some people have suggested a Planner icon of some sort and I'd agree that it's maybe a solid idea but personally, the current icon is probably fine as-is.",
